{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/972567-home-brewed-fantasy","id":972567,"title":"Home brewed Fantasy","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-09-19T09:21:21-07:00","id":972567,"title":"Home brewed Fantasy","content":"I'm running a home brewed Fantasy role play inspired by the dark hero's supplement in the Mirrors book. The hedge and Arcadia are pretty much the same though. I was looking for some Hedge encounter inspiration.<br /> <br /> What's your favorite or most unique hedge encounters","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2191-kevorkiandoctor","name":"Kevorkiandoctor","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"95"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-19T18:18:48-07:00","id":972855,"title":"","content":"The Unmade, they're a creepy and disturbing warning to Mage arrogance, found in the Hedge, made from Mages who visited the wrong parts of Arcadia that refused to make deals with them, so they became, hideous, twisted things, protected by Gentry magic who are amused by their suffering.<br /> <br /> They work better if your playing with a player whose playing a Mage.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-21T09:17:15-07:00","id":973888,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/972567-home-brewed-fantasy?p=972855#post972855\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Unmade, they're a creepy and disturbing warning to Mage arrogance, found in the Hedge, made from Mages who visited the wrong parts of Arcadia that refused to make deals with them, so they became, hideous, twisted things, protected by Gentry magic who are amused by their suffering.<br /> <br /> They work better if your playing with a player whose playing a Mage.</div> </div> </div> </div>Where are these found?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2191-kevorkiandoctor","name":"Kevorkiandoctor","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"95"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-22T11:03:06-07:00","id":974539,"title":"","content":"Im pretty sure it's in dancers in the dusk. And yeah, they are a pretty great example of how the hedge can mess anything up... <br /> <br /> As an alternative, anything related to useing trods... If you can get the sense of paranoia right, they can be pure gold. Something about the only road forward occasionally being the main method of travel for your worst nightmares can make a group panic completely once they hear a jolly song in the distance. <br /> <br /> Also, honorable mention goes out to goblin markets hidden in the hedge.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Decent storyteller. Poor Banjo player.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12373-sarner","name":"Sarner","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12373_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-22T13:05:07-07:00","id":974623,"title":"","content":"Thanks Sarner.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}